      "text": "«singleton»\nLogManager\n────────────────────────────\n-INSTANCE: LogManager\n-loggers: ConcurrentHashMap\n-rootLogger: Logger\n-processor: AsyncLogProcessor\n────────────────────────────\n+getInstance() LogManager\n+getLogger(String) Logger «sync»\n+getRootLogger() Logger\n+shutdown()",
